        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. Employees of the Seafood Department shall perform work in that department only. Seafood sales to be counted as a part of Meat Department sales. The senior Seafood Clerk by store shall have the right to the first forty (40) hour schedule available in their department.",
