        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "F. The Employer and the Union agree that any qualified employee eighteen (18) years or older, regardless of age, race, creed, color, sex or national origin, is eligible to work, and will be given an equal opportunity to work in any job classification covered by this Contract.",
