        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "G. Head Meat Cutters shall be allowed to voluntarily return to the Journeyman classification without loss of seniority upon the giving of thirty (30) days' written notice to the Company. The return of the Head Meat Cutter to the Journeyman classification shall be conditioned upon the Employer having a qualified Head Meat Cutter replacement readily available to assume the responsibilities of the Head Meat Cutter desiring to return to the Journeyman classification.",
